---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Pricing" description="Yevqo pricing and product availability.">
  <div class="page-kicker">04 / PRICING</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Start small.<br/><span>Stay in control.</span></h1>
  <p class="page-lead">The initial Yevqo experience is planned to be free while the core Android server workflow is developed.</p>
  <div class="page-grid" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,520px)">
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">AVAILABLE PLAN / PLANNED</span><h2 style="font-size:30px">Free</h2><p>For getting started with one Android device and the essential project-management workflow.</p><div class="code-line" style="font-size:24px;color:#a5ec79">€0 <span style="font-size:11px;color:#929d91">/ planned</span></div><p style="margin-top:18px">• One connected Android device<br/>• Project workspace<br/>• Basic hosting tools<br/>• Basic monitoring<br/>• Starter templates</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="page-note"><strong>Pricing status:</strong> This is a product direction, not an active subscription offer. No payment or account system is available on this landing page.</div>
</SiteLayout>
